# ========================================
# KEEP THESE FILES (Override above rules)
# ========================================
# Environment examples (templates)
!*ENV_EXAMPLE
!*.env.example
!.env.example

# Documentation
!README.md
!*.md

# Configuration templates
!docker-compose.yml
!Dockerfile
!.dockerignore

# Small test files
!test_data/sample_small.wav
!test_data/sample_image.jpg

# ========================================
# HIPAA Compliance - NEVER COMMIT
# ========================================
# Protected Health Information (PHI)
*PHI*
*phi*
*patient_data*
*medical_records*
real_patient_*/

# Any file with "real", "production", "prod" in name
*real*.json
*production*.json
*prod*.csv

# ========================================
# Notes
# ========================================
# This .gitignore is designed for the Medical AI Agent project
# 
# Key principles:
# 1. Never commit API keys or secrets
# 2. Never commit large model files (use Git LFS or download separately)
# 3. Never commit PHI or real patient data
# 4. Keep templates and example files
# 5. Ignore generated files (audio, logs, cache)
#
# Remember:
# - Mock/demo data is OK to commit
# - Model conversion scripts are OK to commit
# - Documentation and configs are OK to commit
# - Real patient data, API keys, large models are NEVER OK



